#11300
The Great Highway~
   You travel upon the Great Highway through the plains west of Obsidia.  
Constructed long ago by the beings of the city, it is made of black stones like
much of their architecture.  Moving swiftly on the road you silently make your
way into the night and icy wastelands that are the frozen plains of Obsidia.  
