Southwest of Obsidia~
   You reach the border between hot plains and frozen landscape.  Even the
birds have been frozen in mid flight...  Those unfortunate enough to be in
midflight have plunged to their deaths upon the sharp pointing shards of frozen
grass.  Coagulated blood and burst eyeballs litter the ground with debris.  
