#11395
In a Frozen Dwarven Village~
   You stand in the main square of a small dwarven village, now frozen over by
the mysteriously eerie phenomenon.  You see the smokestack rising above the
town hall.  As you near the hall you can hear a pounding on the wooden door.  
You cannot open it.  It is welded shut with frost.  You look through the
window, but all you see is thick black smoke.  There are people inside,
trapped, as a fire fills the hall with suphocating black smoke.  A face hits
the window and slides to the ground.    
