A Frozen Dwarven Farm~
   You see a field of corn and wheat on either side of the farm.  Once lush and
edible, now forever in the frozen food section of your nearest grocery store.
Some cattle grazing in the field were not spared either, their withered bodies
shrivel in the sheer pressure and weight of the frozen ice.  You try to open
the door to the farmhouse with no luck, it is firmly iced shut.  Not even a
fireball could melt this.    
