#11399
Outside the Western Gate of Obsidia~
   You step out onto the great highway leading west out of the dark city.  The
city walls climb skyward to the moon and the black stone of the road gleams in
the night light.  The highway was created long ago to serve as easy passage for
caravans and wagons but are not dusted and somewhat unused.  The plains on the
near horizon are iced over as if some cold wind gripped the land and left it in
still-life.    
